= The Array of Forces

Our enemies are the the radical, revolutionary RFB, with [+ rfb_strength +] thousand troops. The loyalties of the Reichsbanner, with its [+ rb_strength +] members, the Reichswehr, with its [+ reichswehr_strength +] thousand regular soldiers, and Prussian police, with [+ prussian_police_strength +] thousand members, are unclear.

On our side, we have the loyal parts of the Reichsbanner, with [+ rb_strength +] members, and the reactionary SA with [+ sa_strength +] thousand and Stahlhelm with [+ sh_strength +] thousand members.
  
@kpd_revolution_menu

- @reactionary_help: Ask the - ugh - reactionary Stahlhelm and SA to help us.
- @work_return: Demand that strikers return to work!
- @party_discipline: Impose party discipline in an attempt to quell the left wing's dissent.
- @war_outcome: We have done all that we can.

@reactionary_help
max-visits: 1
go-to: kpd_revolution_menu
on-arrival: war_reactionary_help = 1; left_dissent += 10; sa_strength += 50; sh_strength += 100; nsdap_workers += 5; dnvp_workers += 5

The far-right leaders readily agreed to fight against the Bolshevik menace, considering them a common enemy. However, this move comes in the face of mounting criticism and threats of secession from our left wing; what's more, it is likely to strengthen the reactionary parties and paramilitaries.

