Placeholder; either successful, mid, or not at all successful. Calcs based on normalized worker, ppls party, kpd normalized worker, and left strength/labor dissent

@party_discipline
max-visits: 1
go-to: kpd_revolution_menu
on-arrival: war_party_discipline = 1; left_dissent += 15

We have enforced party discipline in an attempt to quell dissent across the SPD. However, this move seems to have provoked our left wing further, alienating them with our heavy-handed approach.
  
